From: jica98 <jica.etzc@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 02:40:53 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] vulkan/wsi: faster software presentation for X11

Prefer a host-cached memory type for the CPU-side present image even when
it is not host-coherent, invalidating the mapping before the present
thread reads it, and let the X11 present thread wait for the image fence
instead of blocking vkQueuePresentKHR until rendering completes.

Generated-by: LLM
